  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Top-up, TACIS, statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Top-up, TACIS, statistik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att bist&#xe5; Goskomstat i att ta fram ett modernt data- orienterat produktionssystem f&#xf6;r statistik, baserat p&#xe5; modern PC- teknik med n&#xe4;tverk, klient-/serverl&#xf6;sningar etc till verktyg. Syftet &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven att st&#xf6;dja anv&#xe4;ndandet av internationellt vedertagen klassificering genom att utveckla en klassificerigsbas. Sv part:SCB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to support Goskomstat, Russia, in the development of a modern database-oriented production system for statistics, based on modern PC-technology, and to develop a system of classifications which will serve as a basis for a unified information collection system directed at integrating statistical information. Swe part:SCB</narrative>
  </description>
